  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper proposes QNNformer, a hybrid Transformer–quantum neural network architecture evaluated on five time‑series benchmarks. Using 4–6 simulated qubits on the Qiskit Aer simulator, the model reports forecasting improvements such as Weather‑96 MAE 0.170 vs PatchTST 0.177 and Electricity‑96 MSE 0.112 vs 0.129. However, all experiments are classical simulations and no computational quantum advantage is demonstrated.",
